# 懵然不知
(pos:成語)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道發生緊嘅事，對周圍嘅情況一啲都唔察覺
eng:completely unaware; totally oblivious to what is happening
<eg>
yue:佢哋兩個拍咗拖成年，你竟然懵然不知？ (keoi5 dei6 loeng5 go3 paak3 zo2 to1 sing4 nin4, nei5 ging2 jin4 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1?)
eng:They have been dating for a whole year, and you were completely unaware of it?

<eg>
yue:啲騙徒喺佢面前偷嘢，佢都懵然不知。 (di1 pin3 tou4 hai2 keoi5 min4 hong6 tau1 je5, keoi5 dou1 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:The thieves stole things right in front of him, but he was totally oblivious to it. [end of text]


